WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.077 --> 00:00:06.455
Suddenly Cora had another idea.

2
00:00:06.456 --> 00:00:08.942
"Wanda, teach us the call!

3
00:00:08.943 --> 00:00:14.211
We'll do it together."

4
00:00:14.212 --> 00:00:30.844
The three friends called and called.

5
00:00:30.845 --> 00:00:36.206
Then they waited.

6
00:00:36.207 --> 00:00:41.171
At last a big shape swam toward them.

7
00:00:41.172 --> 00:00:47.686
"Mama!" Wanda said.

8
00:00:47.687 --> 00:00:52.131
"It was hard to hear you at first," Mama said.

9
00:00:52.132 --> 00:00:55.077
"But then the call grew louder."

10
00:00:55.078 --> 00:01:02.066
"My friends helped me," Wanda said.

11
00:01:02.067 --> 00:01:07.434
The whales thanked the friends and said good-bye.

12
00:01:07.435 --> 00:01:10.476
Cora and Mo headed back to the reef.

13
00:01:10.477 --> 00:01:14.599
They swam through dirty water.

14
00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:20.935
"Oh no!" Mo ducked. "Not again!"

15
00:01:20.936 --> 00:01:23.640
A large net dropped into the water.

16
00:01:23.641 --> 00:01:29.227
Cora and Mo shot away from it.

17
00:01:29.228 --> 00:01:33.724
"Wait!" Mo said. "Look!"

18
00:01:33.725 --> 00:01:39.574
The net was sweeping through the water.

19
00:01:39.575 --> 00:01:44.831
But it wasn't catching fish.

20
00:01:44.832 --> 00:01:48.500
"The net is cleaning the water!" Mo cried.

21
00:01:48.501 --> 00:01:55.020
"It's scooping up garbage!" Cora said.

22
00:01:55.021 --> 00:02:01.131
Soon the sea looked cleaner.

23
00:02:01.132 --> 00:02:03.479
"Look!" Mo said.

24
00:02:03.480 --> 00:02:05.484
The arrow flew by them.

25
00:02:05.485 --> 00:02:09.780
"Yay!" Cora said.

26
00:02:09.781 --> 00:02:14.363
They tried to do the whale's call again.

27
00:02:14.364 --> 00:02:17.539
"We sound terrible!" Mo said.

28
00:02:17.540 --> 00:02:20.541
"We sure do," Cora said.

29
00:02:20.542 --> 00:02:24.922
"No more whale calls!"

